  <!-- EN: karabal -->
  <DA_Karabal.label>卡拉巴</DA_Karabal.label>
  <!-- EN: A large nocturnal bat-like creature who lives in the arid wastes of the world. They primarily feed on blood, which they suck off sleeping animals when twilight descends on the cold dunes.\n\nWhile weaker and smaller than a wolf, the karabal makes up for its size with its bite, injecting an anti-coagulant venom that greatly increases the threat of blood loss. -->
  <DA_Karabal.description>一种像蝙蝠，住在干旱废土的大型夜行动物。当暮光笼罩着寒冷的苍穹时，它们就靠吸食入眠的动物身上的血液为食。\n\n尽管和狼相比还是更弱更小，卡拉巴靠其叮咬弥补了体型差距。其抗凝血毒素会加剧失血风险。</DA_Karabal.description>
